  "question": {
    "text": "The order and degree of the differential equation of all the parabolas which have a fixed length of latus rectum and their axes are parallel to the&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi></math>-axis, are&nbsp;respectively",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "gi16G",
      "text": "<math><mn>2,1</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "lnycB",
      "text": "<math><mn>1,2</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Af2gn",
      "text": "<math><mn>2,2</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "5VMAw",
      "text": "<math><mn>1,1</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let, the length of the latus rectum is <math><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi></math>, then the equation of such family of parabolas is<br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, where,&nbsp;<math><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>k</mi></math> are arbitrary constants</p><p>On differentiating, we get,</p><p><math><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi></math> … <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> … <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />From <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> putting the value of <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get,&nbsp;<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Hence, order <math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo></math> degree <math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
